#. module: connector_extension_woocommerce
#: code:addons/connector_extension_woocommerce/components/adapter.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Could not send \"%(name)s\" because its parent, %(parent)s, was deleted from"
" WooCommerce. What Odoo sends to WooCommerce should not be deleted. For each"
" record it sends, Odoo keeps one link per language. Delete in Odoo all the "
"language links of the parent: Odoo will create it again in WooCommerce the "
"next time it sends this record. If you do not want the parent in "
"WooCommerce, change the parent of this record in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"No s'ha pogut enviar «%(name)s» perquè el seu pare, %(parent)s, s'ha "
"esborrat de WooCommerce. El que Odoo envia a WooCommerce no s'hauria "
"d'esborrar. Per cada registre que envia, Odoo guarda una vinculació per "
"idioma. Esborra a Odoo totes les vinculacions dels idiomes del pare: Odoo el"
" tornarà a crear a WooCommerce la propera vegada que enviï aquest registre. "
"Si no vols el pare a WooCommerce, canvia a Odoo el pare d'aquest registre."

#. module: connector_extension_woocommerce
#: code:addons/connector_extension_woocommerce/components/adapter.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Could not update %s because it was deleted from WooCommerce. What Odoo sends"
" to WooCommerce should not be deleted. For each record it sends, Odoo keeps "
"one link per language. As long as the language links of this record exist, "
"every update from Odoo will fail. If you really do not want it in "
"WooCommerce, delete in Odoo all the language links of this record: if one "
"remains, Odoo will keep trying. If no product uses it, Odoo will not send it"
" again; if a product uses it, now or some day, it will go back to "
"WooCommerce when that product is exported."
msgstr ""
"No s'ha pogut actualitzar %s perquè s'ha esborrat de WooCommerce. El que "
"Odoo envia a WooCommerce no s'hauria d'esborrar. Per cada registre que "
"envia, Odoo guarda una vinculació per idioma. Mentre les vinculacions dels "
"idiomes d'aquest registre existeixin, cada vegada que Odoo l'actualitzi, "
"fallarà. Si realment no el vols a WooCommerce, esborra a Odoo totes les "
"vinculacions dels idiomes d'aquest registre: si en queda alguna, Odoo ho "
"continuarà intentant. Si cap producte no el fa servir, Odoo ja no el tornarà"
" a enviar; si un producte el fa servir, ara o algun dia, tornarà a "
"WooCommerce quan s'exporti aquell producte."

